 "result_text": "I fixed the duplicate `[None]` sections, but I haven't run the tool or any tests.\n\nThe cause was in `aws_google_auth/__init__.py`. When no profile was set, the tool printed the `export` lines and then still wrote the credentials to `~/.aws/credentials` under a section named `None`. A second run wrote that section again, which is what gave aws-cli the `DuplicateSectionError`.\n\nNow the credentials are only written to the AWS files when a profile is given. With no profile, the tool just prints the exports, as before.\n\nIf your credentials file already has `[None]` sections from earlier runs, they won't clean themselves up. Delete them by hand.",
